  Defect reports

The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously
published C++ standards.

   DR    Applied to            Behavior as published                 Correct behavior
LWG 3474 C++20      views::join(e) returned a copy of e when e  returns a nested join_view
                    is a join_view
P2328R1  C++20      non-view range prvalues could not be joined made joinable
                    by join_view

